<title>RUSSIA: Russian RTS index rises 1.84 pct to 365.96.</title>
<headline>Russian RTS index rises 1.84 pct to 365.96.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System RTS 22-share index closed on Wednesday at 365.96, up 1.84 pct from 359.37 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Total market volume was $39.34 million.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
